msgid "Journey J2 (J2 Discover and refer an unregistered infant in Country B): the people assigned to it (its BPMN lanes), the systems that serve it (the system actors that play its lanes, each holding its parts) and the other country’s parts it hands over to, each country’s instances of the DPI-H RA building blocks those parts specialize, and the RA capabilities it realizes."
msgstr "旅程 J2（J2 在 B 国发现并转诊未登记婴儿）：分配给它的人员（其 BPMN 泳道），为它服务的系统（承担其泳道的系统参与者，各自持有其部件）及其移交给的另一国部件，这些部件所特化的 DPI-H RA 构建块在各国的实例，以及它所实现的 RA 能力。"

#: archimate/0.1.0/model.json:0
msgid "Journey J3 (J3 Verify, import and schedule at the home clinic): the people assigned to it (its BPMN lanes), the systems that serve it (the system actors that play its lanes, each holding its parts) and the other country’s parts it hands over to, each country’s instances of the DPI-H RA building blocks those parts specialize, and the RA capabilities it realizes."
msgstr "旅程 J3（J3 在所属诊所验证、导入并制定接种计划）：分配给它的人员（其 BPMN 泳道），为它服务的系统（承担其泳道的系统参与者，各自持有其部件）及其移交给的另一国部件，这些部件所特化的 DPI-H RA 构建块在各国的实例，以及它所实现的 RA 能力。"

#: archimate/0.1.0/model.json:0
msgid "Journey J4.0 (J4.0 Issue the family's records to one phone as VHLs): the people assigned to it (its BPMN lanes), the systems that serve it (the system actors that play its lanes, each holding its parts) and the other country’s parts it hands over to, each country’s instances of the DPI-H RA building blocks those parts specialize, and the RA capabilities it realizes."
msgstr "旅程 J4.0（J4.0 将家庭记录以 VHL 形式签发到同一部手机）：分配给它的人员（其 BPMN 泳道），为它服务的系统（承担其泳道的系统参与者，各自持有其部件）及其移交给的另一国部件，这些部件所特化的 DPI-H RA 构建块在各国的实例，以及它所实现的 RA 能力。"

#: archimate/0.1.0/model.json:0
msgid "Journey J4.1 (J4.1 Read a family member's records at the point of care abroad): the people assigned to it (its BPMN lanes), the systems that serve it (the system actors that play its lanes, each holding its parts) and the other country’s parts it hands over to, each country’s instances of the DPI-H RA building blocks those parts specialize, and the RA capabilities it realizes."
msgstr "旅程 J4.1（J4.1 在境外医疗服务点读取家庭成员的记录）：分配给它的人员（其 BPMN 泳道），为它服务的系统（承担其泳道的系统参与者，各自持有其部件）及其移交给的另一国部件，这些部件所特化的 DPI-H RA 构建块在各国的实例，以及它所实现的 RA 能力。"

